{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47419","headline":"哭张道古 · 郑遨","name":"哭张道古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾陈章疏忤昭皇，扑落西南事可伤。\n岂使谏臣终屈辱，直疑天道恶忠良。\n生前卖卜居三蜀，死後驰名遍大唐。\n谁是後来修史者，言君力死正颓纲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑遨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}